        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Betterstack -> Zendesk Poller\n\n**Cadence**: every 5 minutes.\n\n**Scope query**: `tags:betterstack-open status<solved`. Returns at most\na handful of tickets in steady state.\n\n**Purpose**: Catches resolved-event webhooks that the receiver missed.\nBoth paths converge on resolve sub-workflow `FXjwcoWpPhmv76ws`, which is idempotent via the `betterstack-resolved` sentinel tag.\n\n**Spec**: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-09-betterstack-zendesk-incident-workflow-design.md`",
          "color": 4
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "808d9672-8dd4-4845-a241-d8953f0883e6",
        "name": "Sticky Note 88e01df8",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          784,
          864
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## HTTP Request Resilience\n\n`Get Betterstack Incident` is configured to:\n\n- `neverError: true` + `fullResponse: true` -- the node succeeds on 4xx/5xx\n  and exposes `statusCode`, `headers`, `body` to downstream nodes.\n- `retryOnFail: true`, `maxTries: 3`,\n  `waitBetweenTries: 2000ms` -- node-level retry on\n  transport errors. Does NOT fire on 4xx/5xx because `neverError` already\n  promotes those to \"successful\" responses.\n\n**Rate limits**: Betterstack does not publish a numeric rate limit.",
          "color": 5
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "b4a889c0-e6f8-4d85-8750-54321c45e47f",
        "name": "Sticky Note 57626254",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          784,
          864
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## 404 Handling Rationale\n\nA 404 from `GET /api/v3/incidents/<id>` means the incident was deleted on\nthe Betterstack side. We strip `betterstack-open` (preserving the\n`betterstack-incident-<id>` audit tag) and append an internal comment.",
          "color": 5
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "638368d6-f376-4d09-a29c-e2e82c8feeeb",
        "name": "Sticky Note 896e23f1",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          784,
          864
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Idempotency\n\nEvery resolve action is gated by the `betterstack-resolved` tag inside the\nresolve sub-workflow. The 404 strip-tag path is naturally idempotent: once\n`betterstack-open` is gone, the Zendesk Search no longer returns the ticket.",
          "color": 5
        }
      }
    ],
